  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Isotropic 3D electron microscopy data of isolated murine pancreatic islets treated with low glucose (jrc_mus-pancreas-3) (2022) in Figshare. 2 citations.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Isotropic 3D electron microscopy data of isolated murine pancreatic islets treated with low glucose (jrc_mus-pancreas-3) (2022) in Figshare is authored by Technology Group, FIB-SEM, Mueller, Andreas and Solimena, Michele. Topics: Islet, Pancreatic islets, Chemistry, Pancreas and Ultrastructure.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">2 citations (OpenAlex). Citations peaked in 2023 with 1 citing works. Citing venues include bioRxiv (Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory) and Nature Communications.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Limited online visibility beyond citations.</p>",
  "provenance": {},
